<title>GREECE: Greek retail sales rise 13.0 pct yr/yr in July.</title>
<headline>Greek retail sales rise 13.0 pct yr/yr in July.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's retail sales (turnover) rose 13.0 percent year-on-year in July after rising 6.7 percent in June, the National Statistics Service (NSS) said.</p>
</text>
